          "start": 402
        },
        "quote": "Each person requesting a new City water service line connection to the water distribution system shall pay all connection costs, which include water system fees, water service installation fees, tap fees, and other charges, as applicable.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.070:block:2#text",
